WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:07.820
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:14.330
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:16.160
It's my day!

00:00:22.270 --> 00:00:26.740
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:34.150
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.110 --> 00:00:41.520
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.190 --> 00:00:48.930
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.130 --> 00:00:54.700
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:01.840
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.010 --> 00:01:09.350
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.050 --> 00:01:15.490
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:15.490 --> 00:01:18.560
I just want to walk

00:01:18.890 --> 00:01:22.090
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.330 --> 00:01:26.060
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.030 --> 00:01:34.970
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:34.970 --> 00:01:41.410
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:41.410 --> 00:01:43.680
It's my day!

00:01:53.590 --> 00:01:58.150
I'm sorry, but I noticed that you seem
to be short on funds,

00:01:58.150 --> 00:02:00.100
so I had this prepared for you.

00:02:00.630 --> 00:02:03.740
As you know, Tsukasa has
a great future before him.

00:02:04.070 --> 00:02:06.790
He's reached the age 
where he must be careful

00:02:06.790 --> 00:02:08.910
to avoid even the tiniest of pebbles.

00:02:09.740 --> 00:02:13.040
<i>She wants me to stay away
from Domyoji for 50 million yen?</i>

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:17.380
<i>What a laugh! It's him
who's been chasing after me!</i>

00:02:21.650 --> 00:02:22.690
SALT

00:02:30.060 --> 00:02:32.930
Take your money... and get out!

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:47.650
Don't you rich people know how it feels
to have your child insulted?

00:02:48.910 --> 00:02:49.810
<i>Mom!</i>

00:02:51.180 --> 00:02:59.660
"It's Showdown Time!"

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:08.670
President!

00:03:11.700 --> 00:03:12.370
<i>Oh, no...</i>

00:03:17.810 --> 00:03:21.680
I understand how you feel.
Is that your final answer?

00:03:22.210 --> 00:03:23.010
It is.

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:27.950
Very well. Shall we go, Nishida?

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:29.090
Yes, ma'am.

00:03:34.460 --> 00:03:35.760
Good-bye...

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:53.810
<i>I can't believe it...
Mom turned down 50 million yen...</i>

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:57.720
<i>I guess she has maternal feelings
towards me after all...</i>

00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:02.820
Thank you, Mom.

00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:06.890
You were wonderful!
I'm impressed!

00:04:07.530 --> 00:04:08.390
Aren't you, Dad?

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:10.160
Y-Y-yes...

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:23.680
I feel strong enough to go on
and live my own life.

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:26.840
Even if I'm poor, I won't bend
to those with money and power.

00:04:29.850 --> 00:04:31.580
But honestly, that woman...

00:04:31.880 --> 00:04:34.750
She's got a lot to learn,
if she thinks she can buy me off.

00:04:35.590 --> 00:04:36.950
What are you talking about?!

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:37.860
Huh?

00:04:38.260 --> 00:04:39.990
I have a plan in mind!

00:04:42.890 --> 00:04:45.000
The parents <i>have</i> to die
before their son.

00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:50.800
Instead of just the 50 million,
we should snag the entire fortune!

00:04:55.170 --> 00:04:57.450
You've got to marry Domyoji.

00:04:57.450 --> 00:04:59.080
Then when his mother's dead...

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:01.470
...you rake in
the entire fortune...

00:05:01.470 --> 00:05:03.110
...or my plan will have been
for nothing.

00:05:03.880 --> 00:05:06.480
Your dad and I will live long,
so hang in there!

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:12.260
W-what are you talking about?!

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:14.760
What do you mean by
"just the" 50 million?!

00:05:14.760 --> 00:05:17.760
You should've
just taken the money!

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:20.500
Are you <i>really</i> my mother?!

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:22.970
Hey! Stop it!

00:05:24.540 --> 00:05:28.010
<i>I'm sick of this!
Everyone pisses me off!</i>

00:05:47.060 --> 00:05:47.930
Mr. Nishida!

00:05:49.430 --> 00:05:50.290
Miss Tsubaki...

00:05:51.900 --> 00:05:54.300
Where did you go
with my mother this morning?

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:57.340
She had an important meeting
with someone...

00:05:57.740 --> 00:05:58.440
So we were there.

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:00.810
You went to the
Makinos' home, didn't you?

00:06:02.910 --> 00:06:03.710
It's true, isn't it?

00:06:05.740 --> 00:06:07.950
What does she plan to do
to Tsukasa?

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:09.950
Tell me.

00:06:11.550 --> 00:06:14.390
I'm sorry, but I cannot.

00:06:37.110 --> 00:06:38.680
<i>Watch out, Tsukasa...</i>

00:06:54.830 --> 00:06:55.530
Ta-da!

00:07:03.430 --> 00:07:04.940
There's even an angry one.

00:07:06.170 --> 00:07:10.010
Let's see... That stupid Rui
went and ate one...

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:13.210
He's been like this all morning.

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:16.050
He must be really happy.

00:07:16.750 --> 00:07:18.950
Ah, here it is... Look!

00:07:19.450 --> 00:07:22.450
Forget that. What about your
magical night together?

00:07:24.090 --> 00:07:26.960
Don't play dumb.
You did it, didn't you?

00:07:29.030 --> 00:07:33.300
In your case, you'll need a <i>fait accompli,</i>
or you'll get nowhere.

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:34.800
A fate...?

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:37.100
Never mind. It doesn't matter.

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:38.670
A fate...?

00:07:39.470 --> 00:07:42.210
Did you do it? Or didn't you?
Just answer that.

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:53.420
HAD SEX

00:07:54.190 --> 00:07:55.190
He did it.

00:07:56.520 --> 00:07:58.150
So, he finally did it!

00:07:58.150 --> 00:08:00.850
Way to go, Tsukasa.
Now you're a man!

00:08:00.850 --> 00:08:02.340
I didn't do anything.

00:08:02.340 --> 00:08:04.160
Come on, don't be shy.

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:06.200
I said I didn't do it!

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:17.480
Why couldn't you?
And you call yourself a man?!

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:19.160
A virgin at 18...

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:21.780
How embarrassing.
You can't tell anyone!

00:08:26.990 --> 00:08:30.890
I don't want to force her into doing it.
I'm not like you guys.

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:36.030
What are you accusing us of?
We always have mutual consent.

00:08:36.330 --> 00:08:41.600
You know Makino. It'll be 50 years
before she feels ready.

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:53.440
That's why you should play the field
instead of just chasing after her.

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:56.810
Did you see your mother's face
when she saw Makino?

00:08:57.280 --> 00:08:59.250
It was like she was looking
at a bug.

00:09:01.690 --> 00:09:04.320
No way are my parents
going to decide how I live!

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:08.690
Those are the words of the heir
to a zaibatsu?

00:09:08.990 --> 00:09:10.700
Not very convincing.

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:18.270
Anyway, we're looking forward
to the consummation of your love.

00:09:18.900 --> 00:09:19.570
Consumption...?

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:20.970
Never mind...

00:09:22.870 --> 00:09:24.240
We'll show you the ropes.

00:09:24.840 --> 00:09:26.200
First, the bra...

00:09:26.200 --> 00:09:27.010
B-bra...?

00:09:33.720 --> 00:09:36.450
Tsukushi... You've lost some weight,
haven't you?

00:09:37.420 --> 00:09:38.650
Oh, really?

00:09:38.650 --> 00:09:42.190
What's with that look?
I envy you.

00:09:42.890 --> 00:09:46.030
Envy? It's because of stress.

00:09:46.630 --> 00:09:48.570
Stress? What kind?

00:09:49.130 --> 00:09:50.000
Well...

00:09:52.340 --> 00:09:54.010
<i>I have an awful feeling...</i>

00:09:59.040 --> 00:10:05.550
<i>That fleeting smile... There's no way
she'll give up so easily.</i>

00:10:31.040 --> 00:10:32.510
Gardenias...

00:10:33.510 --> 00:10:35.710
<i>Oh, look at the pretty flowers!</i>

00:10:37.450 --> 00:10:38.520
<i>They smell so nice.</i>

00:10:39.150 --> 00:10:40.320
<i>Say, Tsubaki...</i>

00:10:42.690 --> 00:10:46.020
<i>Have you ever seen the berry
of that plant?</i>

00:10:47.590 --> 00:10:48.530
<i>No...</i>

00:10:49.390 --> 00:10:52.530
<i>The flowers are white like this,
but the berries are orange.</i>

00:10:53.230 --> 00:10:55.270
<i>They're used in dyes and medicines.</i>

00:10:56.700 --> 00:10:59.970
<i>Even after the flowers die,
this plant helps people.</i>

00:11:00.370 --> 00:11:02.970
<i>That's why I like this plant.</i>

00:11:13.020 --> 00:11:13.990
Say, Tsubaki...

00:11:19.690 --> 00:11:23.160
The flowers are white like this,
but the berries are orange.

00:11:59.960 --> 00:12:01.970
The Overseas Youth Cooperative?

00:12:02.930 --> 00:12:06.040
Yes. After elementary school,

00:12:06.040 --> 00:12:09.610
my dad's job took us
everywhere, overseas.

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:12.780
I graduated from a British university.

00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:25.660
And when I returned to Japan,
I couldn't find anything I really wanted to do.

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:29.830
I felt I should see more
of the world.

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:36.600
So I left again, and lived
in Cambodia and Africa for a while.

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:38.640
I see...

00:12:40.840 --> 00:12:44.380
But when my dad died,
I got called back to Japan.

00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:47.380
And here I am, back at Eitoku...

00:13:15.340 --> 00:13:17.810
You're a gardenia, aren't you?

00:13:18.140 --> 00:13:18.710
Huh?

00:13:19.310 --> 00:13:19.940
Nothing...

00:13:24.680 --> 00:13:27.750
I must say your brother
is certainly interesting.

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:30.370
I look forward to seeing
how he grows up.

00:13:30.370 --> 00:13:31.760
So do I...

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:36.160
He's a silly kid... but he...

00:13:41.530 --> 00:13:42.870
He may have reached
a dead end...

00:13:43.270 --> 00:13:43.700
Huh?

00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:48.640
I didn't want him to suffer
like I did.

00:13:59.120 --> 00:14:00.120
Tsubaki...

00:14:15.230 --> 00:14:19.400
50 million?!
Mrs. Domyoji brought it with her?

00:14:19.400 --> 00:14:19.970
Yeah.

00:14:20.910 --> 00:14:24.510
Boy, we really <i>do</i> live in different worlds.

00:14:24.510 --> 00:14:26.240
She's too much!

00:14:28.410 --> 00:14:29.970
You didn't take that money...

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:32.020
Does it mean you're going to
keep seeing him?

00:14:32.320 --> 00:14:33.380
Of course not!

00:14:33.380 --> 00:14:35.950
I'd never get along
with a mother-in-law like that!

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:37.320
Mother-in-law?

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:42.660
Going out with him doesn't mean
you've got to marry him!

00:14:43.430 --> 00:14:46.010
I know! I know, but...

00:14:46.010 --> 00:14:48.530
That's not the way it works
in their world.

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:52.270
It's a weird world that
we normal people can't understand!

00:14:57.080 --> 00:15:00.180
We can't enter their world.
I wouldn't want to.

00:15:01.710 --> 00:15:03.820
I learned that lesson well, today.

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:11.230
What she did...

00:15:11.230 --> 00:15:13.890
...is something a warm-blooded
human couldn't do.

00:15:14.230 --> 00:15:16.890
Tsukasa's mother is underhanded.

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:21.930
I don't think you'd fit into that world.

00:15:24.870 --> 00:15:30.880
With everything you've suffered at Eitoku,
I want you to be happy.

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:34.650
Yuki...

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:39.650
You'll probably run into a lot of problems
if you keep seeing Domyoji.

00:15:42.820 --> 00:15:43.960
Probably...

00:15:49.390 --> 00:15:53.970
<i>I'll make it clear to him...
there's no hope. It's no use.</i>

00:15:56.330 --> 00:15:59.840
<i>Besides, it's probably
just a crush for him...</i>

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:02.070
<i>He'll come to his senses soon.</i>

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:06.940
Welcome...

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:20.220
<i>Oh, he's the one
who came this morning...</i>

00:16:21.060 --> 00:16:24.760
The President sent me.
Please read this.

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:37.880
<i>Today, at 6:00 PM,</i>

00:16:38.240 --> 00:16:41.550
<i>I will be awaiting you in the Kikyo Room
at the Maple Hotel.</i>

00:16:42.150 --> 00:16:44.050
Will you come with me, please?

00:16:45.180 --> 00:16:49.590
<i>Let's clarify your future with Tsukasa,
this evening.</i>

00:16:56.960 --> 00:16:57.600
Master...

00:16:58.600 --> 00:17:00.930
I must ask you to come with us.

00:17:01.930 --> 00:17:04.940
Hey, aren't you
the nag's bodyguards?

00:17:05.800 --> 00:17:06.900
It's the President's order.

00:17:07.770 --> 00:17:08.770
You will come with us.

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:22.190
<i>I said I'd go by train...</i>

00:17:22.590 --> 00:17:24.790
<i>What am I doing, riding
in the enemy's car?</i>

00:17:26.790 --> 00:17:29.480
<i>For you to have a boyish crush
on a little bug like her...</i>

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:31.630
<i>How will I explain it to your father?!</i>

00:17:33.630 --> 00:17:36.600
<i>I want Tsukushi to give Tsukasa up.</i>

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:39.740
<i>I'm willing to give her an incentive.</i>

00:17:40.840 --> 00:17:41.640
<i>What?!</i>

00:17:47.380 --> 00:17:51.250
<i>I swear! I'm going to tell that hag off!</i>

00:17:52.150 --> 00:17:56.250
<i>Looking down her nose at me!
That's why I hate the rich!</i>

00:17:57.320 --> 00:18:00.890
<i>She thinks we poor people
will do anything for money!</i>

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:02.290
<i>How smug can you get?!</i>

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:08.170
<i>Yeah! I'm wound up just right!</i>

00:18:10.800 --> 00:18:12.320
<i>Just what I need to
fuel my fire!</i>

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:13.140
We have arrived.

00:18:24.550 --> 00:18:27.990
<i>This is the hotel that
Domyoji's mom owns?</i>

00:18:34.390 --> 00:18:38.230
<i>Ohh... I'm dizzy...</i>

00:18:41.130 --> 00:18:43.200
<i>Stop that!
Pull yourself together!</i>

00:18:43.970 --> 00:18:45.070
Are you all right?

00:18:45.070 --> 00:18:45.970
Sure!

00:18:46.500 --> 00:18:49.970
Where's the witch? 
Take me to her!

00:18:50.510 --> 00:18:51.340
W-witch?

00:18:56.180 --> 00:18:57.620
<i>I won't back down!</i>

00:19:11.760 --> 00:19:14.730
Let go of me!
I'll have you all fired!

00:19:14.730 --> 00:19:18.060
Please, Master Tsukasa.
Lower your voice!

00:19:18.060 --> 00:19:19.900
Let go! I'll kill you!

00:19:20.270 --> 00:19:22.110
Why the hell
am I dressed like this?

00:19:22.110 --> 00:19:23.810
What are you going
to do with me?

00:19:41.690 --> 00:19:44.700
Makino... What are you...?

00:19:47.270 --> 00:19:48.100
Everyone...

00:19:49.130 --> 00:19:50.300
Are we all here?

00:19:53.100 --> 00:19:55.110
What are you scheming,
you old hag?!

00:19:56.610 --> 00:19:59.380
What are you trying to do,
bringing Makino here, too?

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:12.460
Isn't the other party here yet?

00:20:13.320 --> 00:20:13.890
No, not yet.

00:20:14.590 --> 00:20:17.060
<i>Other party?
Who else are they expecting?</i>

00:20:19.630 --> 00:20:20.800
I'm sorry to keep you waiting.

00:20:20.800 --> 00:20:21.970
What's going on?!

00:20:21.970 --> 00:20:25.140
Hey, what's going on?
Why'd I have to dress like this?!

00:20:25.600 --> 00:20:27.070
No one's told me anything!

00:20:29.170 --> 00:20:30.580
I'll clock you with my heels!

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:33.810
Let me go! Let me go, I said!

00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:36.350
Let go of me!

00:20:36.910 --> 00:20:40.750
It hurts! Ow! It hurts!

00:20:50.090 --> 00:20:52.700
This is Shigeru Okawahara.

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:55.870
Tsukasa, this is your fiancé.

00:21:57.330 --> 00:22:03.940
Will I ever make it that far?

00:22:03.940 --> 00:22:08.710
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:22:10.510 --> 00:22:18.150
Some day, the whole world

00:22:18.150 --> 00:22:23.960
will have its eyes on me.

00:22:23.960 --> 00:22:31.730
Yeah, after our graduation ceremony

00:22:31.730 --> 00:22:37.340
we all wrote our dreams on the wall.

00:22:37.340 --> 00:22:43.980
A lot of time has passed since then

00:22:43.980 --> 00:22:50.350
but I'm just the same as I was on that day!

00:22:50.350 --> 00:22:57.260
Keep trying your best! 
Wishes can come true!

00:22:57.260 --> 00:23:06.130
Let's keep running down
 the road we believe in!

00:23:07.430 --> 00:23:14.040
Will I ever make it that far?

00:23:14.040 --> 00:23:20.110
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:23:20.650 --> 00:23:27.390
Will I ever make it that far?

00:23:27.390 --> 00:23:30.760
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:23:30.760 --> 00:23:36.630
I already made it this far, after all.

00:23:47.710 --> 00:23:53.180
Shigeru... Okawahara?
They say she's Tsukasa's fianc馥.

00:23:53.810 --> 00:23:57.550
Last night, when I bit his ear,
he turned bright red.

00:23:57.920 --> 00:24:01.190
<i>That rat... I'll bet he's been
hanging out with her.</i>

00:24:01.950 --> 00:24:04.720
Hana Yori Dango: 
"I Will Tame You!!"

00:24:05.160 --> 00:24:07.830
Jeez, she's something else!
